  id: sirelle
  dexNumber: 207
  displayName: Sirelle
  lore: She swims through the air as easily as the lagoon, trailing her hair like
    weed in a current. Sailors of the Driftkeys say her song pulls boats onto the
    reef, and that nobody on board minded.
  personality: Playful, flirtatious, collects shiny things from wrecks.
